-- Replace the entire previous LocalScript in StarterPlayerScripts.
-- Drag the title or ESP button. Minus minimizes; X / "Удалить ESP" unloads.
-- Mobile starts in Lite mode with an optimized budget: 15 Hz, 14 markers, 4 outlines, 4 labels.
-- Mobile Lite also throttles target scans, drone discovery, team classification and label refreshes.
-- AUTO mode: current PlaceId/name + runtime signatures choose TLF or generic team detection.
-- Distant/unloaded server characters cannot be recovered by a LocalScript.
-- ScreenGui priority affects 2D markers, not Roblox's system UI or 3D Highlight.
-- Drone discovery: Workspace.SpawnedDrones + the model name patterns from ff.lua.
-- Drone colors identify bot/player control and available team data; damage/armed flags are status text.
-- Unknown drones remain visible when filtering allies. Camera proximity is NOT ownership.
-- Uses Roblox GUI/Highlight; no Drawing API or downloaded UI library is required.
-- Yellow BOT requires replicated AI metadata; missing ownership remains unknown/gray.
-- X / the floating X button locks horizontal yaw while vertical aim stays free.
-- When the view is inside a drone, X also stabilizes that viewed drone yaw client-side.

